  "proof": [
    "A common two-source exact linear combination has form C(3x2)*D(2x3), so every such 3x3 minor has determinant zero.",
    "Target BF16-RNE preimages are contained in closed midpoint cells. Subtracting any residual of magnitude at most11 places the putative rank2 matrix inside the independently reconstructed expanded cells.",
    "For each of six determinant monomials, repeated exact integer interval multiplication encloses all products. Adding signed intervals conservatively encloses every determinant, without enumerating full matrix corners.",
    "The resulting lower bound is strictly positive, so the entire rank2 family is impossible inside these rounding/error boxes."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "The bound excludes a common pair of arbitrary source profiles with row-dependent exact coefficients, including any common pair of saved DY rows. It does not exclude different source pairs for each M or three shared profiles.",
